  triage:title "Array admission uses read-then-batch-insert instead of atomic check-and-insert" ;
  triage:description "Array admission (peer_array.rs:189-229) uses a plain read-then-later-batch-insert instead of an atomic check-and-insert like the singleton path; a race can silently swallow a MessageIdConflict that should be raised, breaking idempotent-replay semantics." ;
